<title>SWEDEN: Swedish research institute sees '97 CPI up 0.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish research institute sees '97 CPI up 0.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Retail and Wholesale Research Institute (HUI) said on Wednesday it expected Sweden's 1997 consumer price index (CPI) to gain 0.9 percent and jump 2.2 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>HUI forecast gross domestic product (GDP) up 1.8 percent in 1997 and up 3.1 percent 1998.</p>
